                        Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                        pp. 67</ref>, <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_71">71</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v02#pg_73">73</ref>, and <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v02#pg_75">75</ref>.</p>
            </note>
